      ],
      "note": "Cards: latest reading; 30-day average (daily series) or 3-month average (monthly) vs the trailing 1-year average; and the percentile of that average against its full history. The indexes count newspaper articles on each theme (higher = more risk/uncertainty). Daily indexes are noisy, so the charts use moving averages.",
